    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nRelevant: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/32280\nAnd see this discussion: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/discussions/40640\n\nI'd like to control the sort of files rendered by `dir.lua`. My needs are very specific, but:\n\n- Sort by file modification timestamp\n- Sort ascending and descending\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThere are various knobs to control the sorting!",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-14T16:25:33Z",
    "closed_by": {
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}",
